{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports"},"abstract":[{"text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"rejectionReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","text":"AsyncStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","text":"RejectionReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker’s worker checks each event’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"constraintViolation()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before anything else, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rejected event is never enriched, held by a consent, written to a store or delivered. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"record a store recovered is checked too, and one rejected is forgotten by the store. In","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"debug builds each rejection is also logged at error level.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a rejection joins the waiting report of the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event, property and keyword, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reports waiting unread are at most one per constraint the app declares, however many events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"break them. Copies of a tracker share one sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker has finished. A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" tracker’s is empty.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"rejectionReports","externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV16rejectionReportsScSyAA15RejectionReportVGvp","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L214"},"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","text":"RejectionReport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/rejectionReports":{"title":"rejectionReports","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"rejectionReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"RejectionReport","preciseIdenti